  <Description>Stored-procedure dataset with a single-value date parameter and a multi-value region parameter. The target procedure (dbo.usp_SalesByDateAndRegion) is expected to receive @Region as a comma-joined string and split it internally with STRING_SPLIT(@Region, ','), since a stored procedure call cannot bind a native multi-value array parameter.</Description>
